I'll come right back!

2305
01:10:22,720 --> 01:10:24,120
(Back and forth)
They're all about that push and pull.

2306
01:10:24,640 --> 01:10:25,640
They're testing each other.

2307
01:10:25,640 --> 01:10:26,440
Didn't they say

2308
01:10:26,440 --> 01:10:27,040
they're both

2309
01:10:27,040 --> 01:10:28,440
people who need reassurance?

2310
01:10:28,440 --> 01:10:30,000
So they always want the other person

2311
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:31,360
to say it first,

2312
01:10:31,360 --> 01:10:32,680
then they'll respond.

2313
01:10:32,680 --> 01:10:33,480
They've got

2314
01:10:33,480 --> 01:10:33,840
a different

2315
01:10:33,840 --> 01:10:34,960
kind of push and pull.

2316
01:10:34,960 --> 01:10:35,320
You know?

2317
01:10:35,320 --> 01:10:36,120
Like fire and water.

2318
01:10:36,120 --> 01:10:37,720
They're always butting heads.

2319
01:10:38,480 --> 01:10:39,040
Both of them

2320
01:10:39,040 --> 01:10:40,480
seem like they want

2321
01:10:40,480 --> 01:10:41,320
(Taking the lead)
the upper hand.

2322
01:10:41,320 --> 01:10:42,440
Right.

2323
01:10:42,440 --> 01:10:43,680
Lucky,

2324
01:10:43,680 --> 01:10:45,120
you two have been through this before.

2325
01:10:45,120 --> 01:10:46,280
Share your experience.

2326
01:10:46,920 --> 01:10:47,520
I feel like we

2327
01:10:47,520 --> 01:10:48,240
weren't really

2328
01:10:48,240 --> 01:10:49,480
the back-and-forth type.

2329
01:10:49,480 --> 01:10:50,160
We were more like

2330
01:10:50,160 --> 01:10:50,800
the "senior version".

2331
01:10:50,800 --> 01:10:51,660
(Senior version)
I think.

2332
01:10:53,600 --> 01:10:54,520
Back then, we'd just

2333
01:10:54,520 --> 01:10:55,840
pull weeds

2334
01:10:55,840 --> 01:10:56,920
and plant flowers.

2335
01:10:56,920 --> 01:10:57,800
The two of us were

2336
01:10:57,800 --> 01:10:58,720
a little too chill.

2337
01:10:58,720 --> 01:10:59,960
You were chill?

2338
01:10:59,960 --> 01:11:01,080
You were anything but.

2339
01:11:01,080 --> 01:11:01,440
Really?

2340
01:11:01,720 --> 01:11:03,000
You were holding his invitation card

2341
01:11:03,000 --> 01:11:03,760
and doing what?

2342
01:11:03,760 --> 01:11:05,040
You were holding his invitation card

2343
01:11:05,040 --> 01:11:05,560
and doing what?

2344
01:11:07,520 --> 01:11:08,280
Here.

2345
01:11:09,900 --> 01:11:10,820
(We've got a longtime viewer here)

2346
01:11:10,900 --> 01:11:12,220
(Is that me?)

2347
01:11:16,400 --> 01:11:17,400
Zeng nervously

2348
01:11:17,400 --> 01:11:19,000
takes a tactical sip of tea.

2349
01:11:20,860 --> 01:11:24,900
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
